33d0758e007418270", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/field-signatory-ar", "words": "اسم المفوض بالتوقيع :"}, {"crop_sha256": "78292ca1e69a01c03e5ca9dcebebf4e5deac42cfeaae51f19d6cb8e1541d93e0", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/field-capacity-en", "words": "Capacity"}, {"crop_sha256": "2472d063cf85cc1ed1c9d69925b2cffbfd6be5b9fe5e80055612830f3af5a684", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/field-capacity-ar", "words": "الصفة :"}, {"crop_sha256": "2ceb57551e4bb9dad6218a87b783defa1370ee4285d56c9474b7fc8708817d8d", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/field-date-en", "words": "Date"}, {"crop_sha256": "2ceb57551e4bb9dad6218a87b783defa1370ee4285d56c9474b7fc8708817d8d", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/field-date-ar", "words": "التاريخ :"}], "id": "S2", "kind": "fact", "text": "The eight units are bilingual field labels of the blank completion block below the beneficial-owner table on the page-4 image (English at left, Arabic at right, each followed by a blank rule line). The image readings are status 'pending'."}, {"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 5, "unit_id": "ADD-03:F4-H/para2", "words": "Note: This Form shall be submitted in the Arabic language for each member of the consortium, and the Arabic text governs."}], "id": "S3", "kind": "fact", "text": "None of the eight labels contains change words (no old/new pair, 'deleted', 'substituted', 'amended', 'reissued') and none contains obligation or exception words ('shall', 'must', 'unless'). The obligation about the form ('shall be submitted in the Arabic language') is printed in a separate note unit, not in these labels."}, {"id": "S4", "kind": "interpretation", "text": "A blank field label of a form is content of the form that the addendum issues; it does not by itself amend, delete or add to any provision. Its effect (issuing Form 4-H) is carried by the Section 8 provisions and the form as a whole, which belong to other batches. So each of these labels is no_effect on its own."}]}, "run_id": "ADD-03-host-20261004T164722Z-4d3d", "ts": "2026-10-04T16:47:22Z"}
